Date: Tue, 5 Nov 2024 05:04:04 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] QSDK CP: wifi: ath12k: Add support for QCA Energy Service

Parse and enable RM-specific services via vendor commands.
Parse RM generic commands to complete the handshake for energy services.
Respond to the successful completion of the RM QCA Energy Service handshake.
Parse vendor NSS adjustment commands from the vendor WiFi configuration command.
Send association and disassociation responses to the RM app for the energy
service algorithm.

Patch-dependency: 982-03-QSDK-CP-wifi-Implement-telemetry-agent-interface.patch
Patch-work: None

Signed-off-by: Sidhanta Sahu <quic_sidhanta@quicinc.com>
